title: Bandit Toll
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: bandit

bandit: Oy, this is a toll road now.
bandit: Pay the toll, or we'll make you wish you had.

choice:
  - [if gold >= 40] Pay 40 gold -> pay
  - Fight -> fight
  - Hand over a card -> card

@pay
  > gold -40
  bandit: A smart choice.
  > end

@fight
  > fight bandit-scribe,bandit-scribe
  bandit: Not too bright are you?
  > end

@card
  > card remove choose 1
  bandit: You probably could have used that further down the road. Too bad.
  > end
